        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/b0aa52a7ec5e4b45f9f5b66a6d85af8b.poster.avif?t=1778663036\" width=780 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/b0aa52a7ec5e4b45f9f5b66a6d85af8b.webm?t=1778663036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/b0aa52a7ec5e4b45f9f5b66a6d85af8b.mp4?t=1778663036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Buster is no ordinary tower defense game - it’s an incremental journey where every run makes you stronger, every upgrade changes your strategy, and every goblin wave is an opportunity to experiment with new towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/1a51b72afdfc2230543aa8d6dfb043a1.poster.avif?t=1778663036\" width=780 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/1a51b72afdfc2230543aa8d6dfb043a1.webm?t=1778663036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/1a51b72afdfc2230543aa8d6dfb043a1.mp4?t=1778663036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic archer towers, as you crush goblin hordes, gather valuable materials to research unique upgrades that unlock new towers, abilities and resource production. Dive deep into a massive skill tree filled with branching paths and powerful synergies. The more you play, the more tools you’ll unlock to obliterate even the toughest enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/b0aa52a7ec5e4b45f9f5b66a6d85af8b.poster.avif?t=1778663036\" width=780 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/b0aa52a7ec5e4b45f9f5b66a6d85af8b.webm?t=1778663036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/b0aa52a7ec5e4b45f9f5b66a6d85af8b.mp4?t=1778663036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Buster is no ordinary tower defense game - it’s an incremental journey where every run makes you stronger, every upgrade changes your strategy, and every goblin wave is an opportunity to experiment with new towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/1a51b72afdfc2230543aa8d6dfb043a1.poster.avif?t=1778663036\" width=780 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/1a51b72afdfc2230543aa8d6dfb043a1.webm?t=1778663036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482250/extras/1a51b72afdfc2230543aa8d6dfb043a1.mp4?t=1778663036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic archer towers, as you crush goblin hordes, gather valuable materials to research unique upgrades that unlock new towers, abilities and resource production. Dive deep into a massive skill tree filled with branching paths and powerful synergies. The more you play, the more tools you’ll unlock to obliterate even the toughest enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
